@startuml
title 9. Proximity unlock (client-side)
autonumber
actor User
participant "Geolocation" as GPS
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Spatial

User -> Client : walking
GPS -> Client : watchPosition update
Client -> Client : recompute distance to each visible POI
alt entered any POI unlock radius
    Client -> Client : mark POI unlocked (enable tap)
end
alt moved beyond current query bounds
    Client -> Gateway : GET /spatial/nearby (new position)
    Gateway -> Spatial : forward
    Spatial --> Client : refreshed POIs
end
note right of Client : unlock is client-side (MVP).\nPersisted unlock = open question.
@enduml
